        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"qwen/qwen3.6-27b\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"Analyze this screenshot, which may be in English or Myanmar language. It must be a KBZPay (KPay) transfer receipt. Verify four conditions: 1) It is explicitly a KPay receipt. 2) The visible recipient phone number digits (masked, showing only the last 4 digits) must be exactly '4044'. 3) The recipient name must be exactly 'U Bhone Khant Min'. 4) The transferred amount (ငွေလွှဲပမာဏ) must be at least 3,000 MMK or above (check both English numerals like 3,000 / 3000 and Myanmar numerals like ၃,၀၀၀ / ၃၀၀၀). In addition to validating, locate and extract the Transaction ID (လုပ်ဆောင်မှုအမှတ်). You must respond ONLY with a raw JSON object. Do not include ```json blocks, markdown wrappers, or explanations. Use this exact schema: {\\\"status\\\": \\\"VALID\\\", \\\"transaction_id\\\": \\\"EXTRACTED_ID_HERE\\\"} if all conditions pass. If any validation condition fails, return {\\\"status\\\": \\\"INVALID\\\", \\\"transaction_id\\\": \\\"\\\"}.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"image_url\",\n          \"image_url\": {\n            \"url\": \"data:image/jpeg;base64,{{ $json.data }}\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reasoning_format\": \"hidden\",\n  \"temperature\": 0,\n  \"max_tokens\": 500\n}",
